WEBVTT

00:02:28.644 --> 00:02:32.023
They just know that the opioids
seem to be offering relief

00:02:32.023 --> 00:02:35.943
without realizing that they could actually
be contributing to the pain.

00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:37.403
I want to be clear here.

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:40.656
Opioids can be effective,
appropriate therapy,

00:02:40.698 --> 00:02:42.867
but they should be prescribed
with great care.

00:02:42.909 --> 00:02:45.328
This is the doctor's responsibility.

00:02:45.369 --> 00:02:48.372
Here's some advice
so you can be an educated patient.

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:51.375
If you or a loved one
experience acute pain,

00:02:51.417 --> 00:02:55.171
ask to explore alternatives
to opioids like Tylenol,

00:02:55.171 --> 00:02:57.882
NSAIDs, muscle relaxants
and physical therapy.

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:00.051
If your doctor
doesn’t bring those up first,